{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.52, "text": " Friday's probably gonna hate me for making this without her."}, {"start": 2.52, "end": 4.28, "text": " Today we're making Ami soup."}, {"start": 4.28, "end": 7.2, "text": " Ami soup is my best friend's absolute favorite Korean food."}, {"start": 7.2, "end": 9.08, "text": " And I know what you're thinking, but don't worry guys,"}, {"start": 9.08, "end": 10.56, "text": " I'm gonna make her a fresh batch."}, {"start": 10.56, "end": 12.32, "text": " This Friday to celebrate her hitting"}, {"start": 12.32, "end": 14.28, "text": " one million followers on Instagram."}, {"start": 14.28, "end": 15.52, "text": " This is just a practice round."}, {"start": 15.52, "end": 16.84, "text": " And yes, I washed my kimchi"}, {"start": 16.84, "end": 19.12, "text": " because we're making Ami soup when not making kimchi soup."}, {"start": 19.12, "end": 20.68, "text": " This recipe is so, so simple."}, {"start": 20.68, "end": 22.6, "text": " And I'm using four different processed meats."}, {"start": 22.6, "end": 25.04, "text": " But the most important ones is the original spam"}, {"start": 25.04, "end": 26.08, "text": " and any type of sauce."}, {"start": 26.08, "end": 27.84, "text": " Also, you can't forget the canned beans."}, {"start": 27.84, "end": 29.8, "text": " You might be thinking baked beans and spam"}, {"start": 29.8, "end": 32.48, "text": " are weird ingredients for traditional Korean dish."}, {"start": 32.48, "end": 33.76, "text": " But long story short,"}, {"start": 33.76, "end": 36.12, "text": " Ami soup was just made after the Korean war."}, {"start": 36.12, "end": 38.32, "text": " Because the US military bases at that time"}, {"start": 38.32, "end": 40.16, "text": " would give out these resources to Koreans"}, {"start": 40.16, "end": 41.4, "text": " due to foods shortage."}, {"start": 41.4, "end": 43.48, "text": " And then Koreans would use that to make soup."}, {"start": 43.48, "end": 44.4, "text": " Hence, Ami soup."}, {"start": 44.4, "end": 46.0, "text": " I used ramen powder packets,"}, {"start": 46.0, "end": 47.48, "text": " which I guess is kind of cheating"}, {"start": 47.48, "end": 49.2, "text": " because I don't need to make my own beef"}, {"start": 49.2, "end": 50.24, "text": " or anchovy broth."}, {"start": 50.24, "end": 52.2, "text": " But this was honestly the game change."}, {"start": 52.2, "end": 54.72, "text": " Also, this is a Korean dish with the minced garlic."}, {"start": 54.72, "end": 55.56, "text": " Don't be shy."}, {"start": 55.56, "end": 57.36, "text": " When you think you put in too much, you didn't."}, {"start": 57.36, "end": 60.08, "text": " So, double it and see you on Friday for Friday's reaction."}], "chunks": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 60.08, "text": "  Friday's probably gonna hate me for making this without her.  Today we're making Ami soup.  Ami soup is my best friend's absolute favorite Korean food.  And I know what you're thinking, but don't worry guys,  I'm gonna make her a fresh batch.  This Friday to celebrate her hitting  one million followers on Instagram.  This is just a practice round.  And yes, I washed my kimchi  because we're making Ami soup when not making kimchi soup.  This recipe is so, so simple.  And I'm using four different processed meats.  But the most important ones is the original spam  and any type of sauce.  Also, you can't forget the canned beans.  You might be thinking baked beans and spam  are weird ingredients for traditional Korean dish.  But long story short,  Ami soup was just made after the Korean war.  Because the US military bases at that time  would give out these resources to Koreans  due to foods shortage.  And then Koreans would use that to make soup.  Hence, Ami soup.  I used ramen powder packets,  which I guess is kind of cheating  because I don't need to make my own beef  or anchovy broth.  But this was honestly the game change.  Also, this is a Korean dish with the minced garlic.  Don't be shy.  When you think you put in too much, you didn't.  So, double it and see you on Friday for Friday's reaction.", "embedding": [0.17719800770282745, 0.739222526550293, -3.1216752529144287, -0.28610754013061523, -0.6781467199325562, -0.47600945830345154, -0.5430992245674133, -0.38089632987976074, 0.1944194883108139, -0.9077475070953369, -1.5283998250961304, 0.6833460927009583, 1.3905270099639893, 0.6993332505226135, 0.7445412278175354, -0.45177072286605835, -0.4209323227405548, -1.6463857889175415, -0.9958826303482056, 2.33081316947937, -0.3237958252429962, -0.3115949332714081, -0.37634918093681335, -0.7904267311096191, 1.4395387172698975, -0.02106430009007454, -0.6895779967308044, 0.8899354934692383, 0.03441919386386871, 0.2481478750705719, -0.2955293357372284, -1.855399489402771, -0.37270960211753845, 0.08531523495912552, -0.5770309567451477, 1.0363725423812866, -0.31407278776168823, 0.36940428614616394, 0.3223778307437897, -0.06725115329027176, 0.40863627195358276, 1.8077529668807983, 0.8535071015357971, -0.46989232301712036, 0.3299974501132965, 0.03936323896050453, 1.1377079486846924, 0.23093971610069275, 0.9297203421592712, -1.2156983613967896, 1.228678822517395, -0.6882800459861755, -1.0875242948532104, -0.8190742135047913, 0.3156525492668152, -0.1833694875240326, 0.3368045687675476, 0.6511222720146179, 0.9683409929275513, 0.2392043024301529, 1.517565131187439, 1.1172116994857788, -0.5860064029693604, 1.3179972171783447, 0.0747089833021164, -0.2919465899467468, -1.2893613576889038, 0.6747997403144836, -0.3863098919391632, -0.039634764194488525, 1.0023784637451172, -0.4431658089160919, 0.3271248936653137, 0.14445362985134125, -0.029851213097572327, 0.6912663578987122, -0.12574772536754608, -0.49199894070625305, -0.2033137083053589, 0.021097984164953232, -0.5027803778648376, -0.0741177499294281, 1.1491223573684692, -1.048801064491272, -0.007848524488508701, 0.11771169304847717, -0.022871585562825203, 0.36667177081108093, -0.6774613857269287, 0.9420902729034424, 0.39910688996315, -